#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:5
#: e6521b761945427ea88d50d740965e00
msgid "Mission Planner Simulation"
msgstr "Mission Planner 仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:7
#: 6e46f7f4600347dbb67995ea32a2a24b
msgid ""
"The Simulation tab provides a SITL (Software in the Loop) simulation "
"capability. Many typical frame types for each Vehicle type have been "
"created. This allows you to see the expected behavior for vehicles in "
"missions, or with a joystick attached, actually be able to fly/drive the "
"vehicle simulation as if with RC. This allows you to see potential effects "
"of parameter changes on vehicle behavior or explore mission generation, "
"without risking your vehicle first."
msgstr ""
"仿真标签页提供 "
"SITL（软件在环）仿真功能，已为每种飞行器类型创建了多种典型机架类型。这使您可以观察飞行器在任务中的预期行为，或连接摇杆后像使用遥控一样实际飞行/驾驶仿真飞行器。此功能允许您在不冒险损坏实体飞行器的前提下，观察参数变更对飞行器行为的潜在影响，或探索任务规划。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:9
#: b06158c8fb6f44d8b91e8decac7184c5
msgid "Demonstration Video"
msgstr "演示视频"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:15
#: 61406852f1ff47d6867f70edffd7bf58
msgid "Setup and Use"
msgstr "设置与使用"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:17
#: d6c822d407144b0aa9cc311812d26b72
msgid ""
"The Simulation uses the same SITL models as those used in the Linux "
"``sim_vehicle.py`` script (see :ref:`dev:sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop`, and uses the current master development branch of the code for "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"仿真使用与 Linux ``sim_vehicle.py`` 脚本中相同的 SITL 模型（参见 :ref:`dev:sitl-simulator-"
"software-in-the-loop`），并使用代码的当前 master 开发分支作为固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:19
#: 4d42b27870f745bbbbaec9caab5c9236
msgid "Open Mission Planner's **Simulation** tab."
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner 的 **Simulation** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:20
#: f768d4ff5d8547db86c26a43367480b0
msgid ""
"Choose your vehicle type and frame (the \"Model\" drop down box). First "
"select the \"Model\" frame type, then click the vehicle it corresponds to. "
"If no \"Model\" (frame) is selected, then a normal plane will be used no "
"matter what vehicle is clicked. If a frame is selected and a vehicle clicked"
" that does NOT correspond to it, undefined results may occur."
msgstr ""
"选择飞行器类型和机架（「Model」下拉框）。先选择「Model」机架类型，再点击对应的飞行器。若未选择「Model」（机架），无论点击何种飞行器，均将使用普通固定翼。若已选择机架但点击了不对应的飞行器，可能出现未知结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:21
#: ef8739e5771a42619b138cccf2b79f56
msgid ""
"Default parameters for that vehicle/frame will be loaded and the simulation "
"started. Mission Planner can be used to control the vehicle, setup missions,"
" alter parameters, etc."
msgstr "该飞行器/机架的默认参数将被加载并启动仿真。可使用 Mission Planner 控制飞行器、设置任务、修改参数等。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:22
#: bebb15314c4446e4ac0956d98cc21b27
msgid ""
"In addition to the normal vehicle parameters, you can also now see and "
"change the \"SIM_x\" (simulation) parameters via the CONFIG/Full Parameter "
"Tree page. See :ref:`dev:sitl-parameters` for a list of these."
msgstr ""
"除正常飞行器参数外，现在还可通过 CONFIG/Full Parameter Tree 页面查看和修改「SIM_x」（仿真）参数，参数列表详见 "
":ref:`dev:sitl-parameters`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:25
#: 59fb3ad6a0504c928f6ab04eca9ebddf
msgid "Extra Command Line"
msgstr "额外命令行"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:27
#: eb40ee562e15444d93e5174591d76787
msgid ""
"The ``Extra command line`` box on the SIMULATION tab, you can start the SITL"
" with various options:"
msgstr "SIMULATION 标签页上的 ``Extra command line`` 输入框可使用多种选项启动 SITL："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:29
#: 7ca88023d47b41d587d5aa6d5784cbc5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Home Location : start simulation at any given location using the command "
"``--home={location}`` where location can be either gps coordinates,altitude "
"ASL and vehicle initial heading, or a named location in the `Autotest "
"locations file "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
msgstr ""
"起始位置：使用命令 ``--home={location}`` 在指定位置启动仿真，location 可以是 GPS "
"坐标、海拔高度和飞行器初始航向，也可以是 `自动测试位置文件 "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/locations.txt>`__"
" 中的命名位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:36
#: db28d4466ca141b0b2a1fcb46cb062df
msgid ""
"Different Default Parameter File: allows using a different default parameter"
" file. If used in conjunctions with the ``Wipe`` checkbox (which wipes any "
"previously changed parameters while running simulations on the chosen "
"vehicle), these parameters will be loaded at simulation start. This avoids "
"having to load and store any parameters desired to be changed for the "
"simulation from the normal defaults."
msgstr ""
"不同的默认参数文件：允许使用不同的默认参数文件。若与 ``Wipe`` "
"复选框（用于清除所选飞行器仿真运行期间更改过的参数）配合使用，这些参数将在仿真启动时加载，从而避免每次从正常默认值手动加载并保存仿真所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:42
#: ba6a496f18584537b0c9893520d592de
msgid ""
"Attach a physical device to a SERIALx port in the sim: You can attach actual"
" devices (GPS, RC, Rangefinder,etc.) to a Windows serial COM port and have "
"it attached to a SERIALx port in the simulation for testing."
msgstr ""
"将实体设备挂载到仿真中的 SERIALx 端口：可将实体设备（GPS、遥控、测距仪等）连接到 Windows 串口 COM 端口，并在仿真中将其挂载到 "
"SERIALx 端口进行测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:49
#: d05d27c5faec4d5fb1bde1ce8ba375d4
msgid ""
"Although not shown in the above video, current version of Mission Plannner "
"will ask if you want to simulate using the Development(master aka "
"\"latest\") or Stable version of the vehicle firmware when you click the "
"vehicle to download the model and parameters and begin the simulation."
msgstr ""
"虽然上述视频未作展示，但当前版本的 Mission Planner "
"在您点击飞行器以下载模型和参数并启动仿真时，将询问您是使用开发版（master，即「latest」）还是稳定版固件进行仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:52
#: 9e7d561576ef4ad4833447c27c7ed885
msgid "Simulating Custom Code Branches"
msgstr "仿真自定义代码分支"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-simulation.rst:54
#: 08379bd50c8543a0b8cb08e2ddddfb0b
msgid ""
"In addition, if you are code developer, you can run SITL using your custom "
"code branch using Mission Planner, either with or without, the physics and "
"visualizations of RealFlight. See the :ref:`Using Your Code Branch with "
"Mission Planner SITL and RealFlightM<mp-sitl-custom-code>` section of "
":ref:`dev:sitl-with-realflight`"
msgstr ""
"此外，如果您是代码开发者，可以使用 Mission Planner 通过自定义代码分支运行 SITL，可选择是否配合 RealFlight "
"的物理引擎和可视化效果。详见 :ref:`dev:sitl-with-realflight` 中的 :ref:`在 Mission Planner "
"SITL 和 RealFlight 中使用您的代码分支<mp-sitl-custom-code>` 部分。"
